# ── Run inputs and outputs ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Structures, trajectories and model weights are large and often unpublished.
# Keep them out of the repository; point at them from a config file instead.
runs/
output/
outputs/
*.pdb
*.cif
*.pse
*.npz
*.pkl
*.log
nohup.out

# Generated analysis products
*_metrics.csv
*_metrics_structural.csv
*_ranked.csv
*_dashboard.html
sequences.fasta

# Allow the committed sample data through the rules above. Named explicitly so
# that generated outputs (demo_ranked.csv and friends) stay ignored.
!examples/demo_metrics.csv
!examples/demo_dashboard.html

# Secrets. Nothing here reads environment variables, but an untracked .env is
# the kind of file that shows up later and should never be committed.
.env
.env.*

